msgstr "Плотность макета"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1134
msgid "Compact"
msgstr "Компактная"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1136
msgid "Spacious"
msgstr "Свободная"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1146
msgid "Custom CSS"
msgstr "Свой CSS"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1147
msgid ""
"Extra CSS injected into the community frontend. Use browser DevTools to "
"find selectors."
msgstr ""
"Дополнительный CSS, добавляемый в публичную часть сообщества. Для поиска "
