#, php-format
msgid "%s page title"
msgstr "Заголовок страницы: %s"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1180
msgid "Tokens: {post_title}, {space_name}, {site_name}"
msgstr "Токены: {post_title}, {space_name}, {site_name}"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1185
#. translators: %s: the singular space label the site owner configured (e.g. space, group).
#, php-format
msgid "%s Title"
msgstr "Заголовок: %s"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1188
msgid "Tokens: {space_name}, {site_name}"
msgstr "Токены: {space_name}, {site_name}"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1197
msgid "Structured Data & Indexing"
msgstr "Структурированные данные и индексирование"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1198
msgid "Schema markup, sitemap inclusion, and noindex rules."
msgstr "Разметка Schema, включение в карту сайта и правила noindex."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1202
msgid "Schema Markup"
msgstr "Разметка Schema"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1206
#. translators: %s: the owner-configured noun (space, topic, reply, member or category), sometimes with a count such as "14 spaces".
#, php-format
msgid "Enable DiscussionForumPosting schema on %s pages"
msgstr "Включить разметку DiscussionForumPosting для страниц: %s"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1211
msgid "XML Sitemap"
msgstr "XML-карта сайта"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1215
msgid "Include community pages in the WordPress XML sitemap"
msgstr "Включить страницы сообщества в XML-карту сайта WordPress"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1220
msgid "Noindex"
msgstr "Noindex"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1225
msgid "Noindex user profile pages"
msgstr "Noindex для страниц профилей"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1230
msgid "Noindex search result pages"
msgstr "Noindex для страниц результатов поиска"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1233
msgid ""
"Moderation queues, composer pages, notifications, edit profile, and invite "
"landings always emit noindex (administrative or personal views, not for "
"search results)."
msgstr ""
"Очереди модерации, страницы создания записей, уведомления, редактирование "
"профиля и страницы приглашений всегда получают noindex (это служебные или "
"личные страницы, им не место в результатах поиска)."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1237
msgid "Twitter / X handle"
msgstr "Имя пользователя в Twitter / X"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1240
msgid ""
"Site handle emitted as twitter:site on every public route. Leave blank to "
"omit."
msgstr ""
"Имя пользователя сайта выводится как twitter:site на каждой публичной "
"странице. Оставьте поле пустым, чтобы не выводить его."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1247
msgid ""
"og:image URL when a route has no image of its own. Falls back to the "
"WordPress site logo / icon when this is empty."
msgstr ""
"URL для og:image, если у страницы нет собственного изображения. Если поле "
"пусто, используются логотип или значок сайта WordPress."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1251
msgid "Verify SEO"
msgstr "Проверить SEO"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1254
msgid "Open XML sitemap"
msgstr "Открыть XML-карту сайта"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1257
#. translators: 1: plural space label, 2: plural topic label, 3: plural space label.
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Confirms /wp-sitemap.xml is reachable and that community URLs (%1$s + %2$s) "
"are listed. New %3$s can take a few minutes to appear after the next ping."
msgstr ""
"Проверяет, что /wp-sitemap.xml доступен и в нём перечислены URL сообщества "
"(%1$s + %2$s). Новые %3$s могут появиться через несколько минут после "
"следующего пинга."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1266
msgid "Social Embeds (Instagram & Facebook)"
msgstr "Встраивание из соцсетей (Instagram и Facebook)"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1268
msgid ""
"YouTube, Vimeo, TikTok, Twitter/X, Spotify, SoundCloud, and TED Talks embed "
"automatically with no setup required. Instagram and Facebook require a free "
"Meta Developer App because Meta deprecated anonymous oEmbed access in "
"October 2020."
msgstr ""
"YouTube, Vimeo, TikTok, Twitter/X, Spotify, SoundCloud и TED Talks "
"встраиваются автоматически, настройка не требуется. Для Instagram и "
"Facebook нужно бесплатное приложение Meta Developer: в октябре 2020 года "
"Meta прекратила анонимный доступ к oEmbed."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1273
msgid "Facebook App ID"
msgstr "ID приложения Facebook"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1276
msgid "Numeric App ID from your Meta Developer dashboard."
msgstr "Числовой ID приложения из панели Meta Developer."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1280
msgid "Facebook App Secret"
msgstr "Секрет приложения Facebook"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1283
msgid "Secret is stored in wp_options and never exposed to the frontend."
msgstr ""
"Секрет хранится в wp_options и никогда не передаётся на сторону посетителей "
"сайта."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1290
msgid "How to create a Facebook App (5 minutes, free)"
msgstr "Как создать приложение Facebook (5 минут, бесплатно)"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1297
#. translators: 1: developers.facebook.com URL, 2: Create App button label
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Go to %1$s and log in with a Facebook account. Click %2$s in the top-right "
"corner."
msgstr ""
"Перейдите на %1$s и войдите с помощью аккаунта Facebook. Нажмите %2$s в "
"правом верхнем углу."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1299
msgid "Create App"
msgstr "Создать приложение"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1307
#. translators: 1: "Other" use-case label, 2: "Business" app type label
#, php-format
msgid ""
"When asked \"What do you want your app to do?\", pick %1$s. When asked for "
"the app type, pick %2$s. Name it anything, e.g. \"My Forum Embeds\"."
msgstr ""
"На вопрос «Что должно делать ваше приложение?» выберите %1$s. На вопрос о "
"типе приложения выберите %2$s. Название может быть любым, например «My "
"Forum Embeds»."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1309
msgid "Business"
msgstr "Бизнес"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1317
#. translators: %s: "oEmbed Read" product label
#, php-format
msgid ""
"On the new app's dashboard, find the %s product in the Products list and "
"click Set Up. It's free."
msgstr ""
"На панели нового приложения найдите продукт %s в списке «Продукты» и "
"нажмите «Настроить». Это бесплатно."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1318
msgid "oEmbed Read"
msgstr "Чтение oEmbed"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1326
#. translators: 1: "Settings > Basic" breadcrumb, 2: App ID label, 3: App Secret label
#, php-format
msgid "Open %1$s. Copy the %2$s and %3$s and paste them into the two fields above."
msgstr "Откройте %1$s. Скопируйте %2$s и %3$s и вставьте их в два поля выше."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1327
msgid "Settings → Basic"
msgstr "Настройки → Основные"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1328
msgid "App ID"
msgstr "ID приложения"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1329
msgid "App Secret"
msgstr "Секрет приложения"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1337
#. translators: 1: "App Review > Requests" breadcrumb, 2: "oembed_read" permission name
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Go to %1$s and request the %2$s permission. Meta typically approves in 1-3 "
"business days. Your app stays in Development Mode until approved; embeds "
"will work for the admin who created the app even before approval."
msgstr ""
"Перейдите в %1$s и запросите разрешение %2$s. Обычно Meta одобряет запрос "
"за 1–3 рабочих дня. До одобрения приложение остаётся в режиме разработки; "
"встраивание будет работать для администратора, создавшего приложение, даже "
"до одобрения."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1338
msgid "App Review → Requests"
